{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015BEVpdmHj6qeshvMe9XoDq","type":"tool_result","content":"# Install\n\nard runs on macOS and Linux. It needs:\n\n- Go (to build), `make` and `git` 2.47.0 or newer. An older git fails some fetches.\n- The `claude` CLI for the default agent.\n- Docker, only for roles that ship a `Dockerfile` (the cve, docs and lint scanners).\n\nBuild from source:\n\n```sh\ngit clone https://github.com/albertcbrown/ard\ncd ard\nmake build\n./bin/ard version\n```\n\nPut `bin/ard` on your `PATH`. A Homebrew cask is planned (#177); this page will point to it once it lands.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"45379bcf-1105-43f4-9d7c-90b4cdbd049a","uuid":"93aabed8-0fd7-407c-8e78-01de0965eb70","timestamp":"2026-11-25T08:50:22.725Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# Install\n\nard runs on macOS and Linux. It needs:\n\n- Go (to build), `make` and `git` 2.47.0 or newer. An older git fails some fetches.\n- The `claude` CLI for the default agent.\n- Docker, only for roles that ship a `Dockerfile` (the cve, docs and lint scanners).\n\nBuild from source:\n\n```sh\ngit clone https://github.com/albertcbrown/ard\ncd ard\nmake build\n./bin/ard version\n```\n\nPut `bin/ard` on your `PATH`. A Homebrew cask is planned (#177); this page will point to it once it lands.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"returnCodeInterpretation":"No matches found","noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_015BEVpdmHj6qeshvMe9XoDq","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
